{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1633221373"}, "name":{"label":"Brightnightfall"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-20T14:15:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.251.0"}, "id":{"label":"13656875770"}, "title":{"label":"Sleek, useful, satisfactory."}, "content":{"label":"My experience with this app in the month I've used it has been overly positive. I was directed to it by a GoodRX article. But, there are two things I would change.\n\nPlease make the baseline mood \"Okay\" instead of \"Very bad.\" \n\nPlease set the medication recording time to the current time, instead of the reminder time. I have a reminder set for 6am, but if I try to record the medication at 9:37am, I would like that to be the time that it suggests. Ir at least make changing this baseline an option. I typically record my medication immediately after taking it, but I do not always take it when my reminder goes off. I'm tired of scrolling every time. This was something the Apple Health app did that I really appreciated.\n\nI stopped using Apple health because I plan to switch to an android device soon. I prefer apps that work for both interfaces.\n\nThe user interface is clean and easy to understand, I love the wide variety of symptoms that i can track, and the ability to track appointments. I also like that this app for unnecessary personal information when I downloaded the app. It didn't hit me with a paywall or an ad for its upgraded version either. And I never see ads on this free version! (Maybe that's because of an adblocker I have? But I don't think so)\n\nThe fact that they let me know when my phone is on silent mode is a neat bonus as well.\n\nThe app is sleek in appearance. It works smoothly, I like its animations and color palette. I've encountered no bugs in the month I've begun to use it, and it's done exactly what I needed it to do. I use MyTherapy, Routinery, and Finch to help me complete my mourning routines and maintain my mental health. The reminders are never annoying, wonderful at standing out amongst my other notifs, and i didn't even have to set them up like that myself.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id559823770"}, "name":{"label":"Rapunzel353"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-16T19:13:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.250.3"}, "id":{"label":"13642202979"}, "title":{"label":"Not what is advertised"}, "content":{"label":"I downloaded this app to be able to have my caregiver be able to see if I’ve taken my meds. The pictures on here are not what the app is. I can’t find those features and the app looks different. It’s very confusing and frustrating", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id131908527"}, "name":{"label":"Jawonder"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-15T17:37:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.250.3"}, "id":{"label":"13638192310"}, "title":{"label":"Missing medication"}, "content":{"label":"I NEED something like this. And I know I would love it.  But the app doesn’t have the med I take. Or at least it doesn’t have the form. It forces me to say I take it weekly but I take it daily. It is a new med that’s only been out for a bit, so I can’t really be upset. I just want someone to see this to maybe update the app to include the new Wegovy tablets", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id31384459"}, "name":{"label":"2SCdoodles"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-11T05:52:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.250.3"}, "id":{"label":"13621152183"}, "title":{"label":"Finally Found What Works"}, "content":{"label":"I kept forgetting my meds because of the demands on my time.  Since downloading this app, I haven’t forgotten!  The app has a pleasant tone that reminds me even when my phone isn’t near by.  The notifications on the home screen mean that even if I don’t hear the tone I get a visual reminder that hovers in the background letting me know it is time for meds.  This app is just what I needed to ensure I don’t miss meds I 💯 percent recommend.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
