{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id344150172"}, "name":{"label":"Bethyc08"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-17T06:41:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.250.2"}, "id":{"label":"13524002424"}, "title":{"label":"Couldn’t live without"}, "content":{"label":"I use this app for daily medication reminders, but I also use it to remind myself to eat lunch and what time to leave the office and what time to leave to go to work. I struggle with time blindness and this app helps me keep track of times throughout the day.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id101397577"}, "name":{"label":"KaedeF"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-14T18:13:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.250.1"}, "id":{"label":"13514893029"}, "title":{"label":"Ads interfering with function"}, "content":{"label":"I get having banner ads, and I can get over having full screen ads before I can see the daily stock photo reward for taking all my meds. But I rely on the notifications when my medications are low and will get ads when a notification banner pops up in app removing the notice before I can read it, then again when I click the medication panel to see which med was getting low. The app is quickly losing its functionality for me, and I can’t afford a monthly subscription to remove ads to let me use the basic functions. Searching for an alternative at this point. Proceed with caution. It used to be great.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
