{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id120533047"}, "name":{"label":"Ashlynkin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-03T14:58:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.248.0"}, "id":{"label":"13471897440"}, "title":{"label":"Very helpful reminder app"}, "content":{"label":"After a recent diagnosis, I now have to take medication. I only take one prescription but sometimes life gets so busy I forget if I actually took it or not. I use this app to help me remember which has been really helpful. The streaks with the photo reveal also help give you a little extra motivation to stay consistent. I like that I can add my provider , how many pills I have left, and future appointments. These are all little things that make the app worth using for me. And they aren’t useless features either especially if I ever need to take more than just one prescription .", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1465873192"}, "name":{"label":"Riptide247"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-27T01:50:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.247.0"}, "id":{"label":"13446249364"}, "title":{"label":"Crashes"}, "content":{"label":"Downloaded latest update and now the app won’t open. Crashes immediately. Sad because it’s been great for a couple of years.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id472990880"}, "name":{"label":"10SewingMachines"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-26T01:46:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.247.0"}, "id":{"label":"13442459668"}, "title":{"label":"Excellent App! Love the Refill Reminders and the progress charts."}, "content":{"label":"I really rely on the MyTherapy App. I have chronic pancreatitis (CP) with experimental pancreatic insufficiency (EPI) and bile acid malabsorption (BAM). This means I take a lot of medications. Some are scheduled and some are “as needed” depending on my symptoms. \n\nOne of my favorite features is the refill reminders. I log when I get my new prescription and how many pills are in the bottle and have it give me a reminder when I get down to a certain number of pills. \nNow I never run out of medications! Particularly ones that have to be ordered by the pharmacy and not always immediately available. \n\nAnother favorite is the progress charts. They let me see at a glance if I have taken my schedules medications and how much as needed pain and nausea medication I have taken. \n\nThe reports let me give my physician a PDF as needed. And makes it much easier for us to discuss treatment regiments especially in conjunction with the symptoms tracker. \n\nSupport team is also available and responsive within 24 hours. \nThank you to the App makers for producing and maintaining this critical app. It has been a gamechanger as my disease progresses and helps relieve anxiety over medication and keeps me on track.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
