{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id870258282"}, "name":{"label":"ResidenciaATC"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-24T16:43:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.239.0"}, "id":{"label":"13180617158"}, "title":{"label":"From Overwhelmed to Organized: The App Every Caregiver Needs"}, "content":{"label":"This is my first year caring for my mom, and MyTherapy has been a game-changer. I started out just wanting a pill minder, but this app does so much more — from tracking medication inventory and refill reminders to graphing health data like blood sugar, blood pressure, mood, pain, and more. All I have to do is consistently log the info, and the app turns it into clear trends I can share with her doctors.\n\nEvery doctor we’ve met has been impressed with the records I’ve provided. After 10 months, I can’t believe it’s still free — it has truly made caregiving so much easier.\n\nHighly recommend to any caregiver or patient who wants peace of mind!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
