{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id286864184"}, "name":{"label":"Cmon918"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-18T13:03:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.231.1"}, "id":{"label":"13032605859"}, "title":{"label":"Simple to use to track"}, "content":{"label":"I was searching for some way to keep track of all the medication’s and vitamins to remember if I took them or not.  This app allows you to schedule the time and what you’re taking when it was so easy to use. I would highly recommend it to anyone who’s time sensitive to the need to take multiple medications.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id209748088"}, "name":{"label":"3M17"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-18T09:42:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.233.1"}, "id":{"label":"13031984018"}, "title":{"label":"Great App"}, "content":{"label":"I went from taking a vitamin and a low dose aspirin with breakfast to adding 2 different eyedrops at three different times and another pill with meals twice a day. I kept forgetting to take one or more or forgetting whether I took it or not. A friend suggested MyTherapy and I feel so much more in charge. The app sends a quick sound, but keeps a notice on my phone so I can’t forget. It has made a huge difference in helping me feel like I’m still in charge. \n\nAnd when I asked what to do if I hit the “Confirm” button on the wrong item, I got a reply that that was not part of the app, but they would look t it. Now it is part of the app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
